1
00:00:03,545 --> 00:00:06,548
Today, we're
working on rhythm.

2
00:00:07,507 --> 00:00:09,551
You've done enough stretching

3
00:00:09,551 --> 00:00:12,637
so let's try some zigzag steps
without touching the poles.

4
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:16,099
Nice and slow.

5
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,018
Wait, I'm finally
allowed to move?

6
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:19,728
No overdoing it.

7
00:00:19,728 --> 00:00:21,646
I'll help you.

8
00:00:21,646 --> 00:00:22,731
Here.

9
00:00:28,826 --> 00:00:29,786
Come on.

10
00:00:29,787 --> 00:00:31,079
No pressure, take it easy.

11
00:00:32,679 --> 00:00:35,015
Head down

12
00:00:35,016 --> 00:00:38,019
eyes on the floor.

13
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:41,666
You're tensing your shoulders.

14
00:00:43,835 --> 00:00:46,463
Watch your knees.

15
00:01:03,938 --> 00:01:05,398
It's okay.

16
00:01:06,149 --> 00:01:09,152
Let's take it slow
and steady together.

17
00:01:34,552 --> 00:01:35,887
Ji-sung?
